        "196",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed17754e8fe3a0ce1fc4571",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "WINNING LIVE楽曲や\\n録りおろしソロ楽曲を収録！\\nCD『WINNING LIVE 03』2/9発売！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8866f95dff67def90e58f0383159781e975b4e05b7e300567ea2347c1617238",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6c5420e87b13c15827e525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ゲーム『ウマ娘 プリティーダービー』\\n1st Anniversary Special Animation\\n「ぱかチューブっ！」にて公開中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecd1f4b5f618bca3d5ca67b1f9c72296af2505a65f914439c9f61ecd8de4a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5776a2ec4854301696745818",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "この方がゴルシちゃんも大きく見えて\\nオマエらも嬉しいよな！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "308cffdce6e1c0efb0caaf95b46472d576f927389a97a25e218094158c10e6ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75633320e59d769adf2fae46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "メジロ家のアフタヌーンパーティー開催！\\n金のレコード盤プレゼントキャンペーンも開催！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afa4366a681740cf77c0633607e35c4f4a39df6c2e5fe0ce3c06b26e78214af8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee33ebeaab53209f85b07bc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "3rd EVENT WINNING DREAM STAGEの\\nDAY1＆DAY2の歌唱シーン映像を全編収録した\\nBlu-rayが6/15発売！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6e45262bb137f5ed71a448f319a15b47487b31d5df866025b126826d66cc73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80136fbbc2257adca24eae5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "公式ポータルサイトもチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab1f9c3ca4a02ab72ab55f56f20d9d1882228f059cf04369e13a4c8713e941a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce1148d1dde2185b5edcd44d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ゲームの楽曲や撮りおろしソロ曲を収録！\\nメジロ家が歌う「メジロ讃歌」も収録！！\\nCD『WINNING LIVE 07』8/17発売予定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22febd8bc5f6dd488a52ce35027a73f2732a40b69ec9b333c96943dbc517be17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2d5432254cfb45a58b1ac9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "1.5th Anniversary 記念グッズ受注開始！\\n詳しくはウマ娘公式ストアをチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab582d7e71d6d2147150c94a31eb2a4674ec49c447a1af6a7a64a980aa3d472",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa95d1a1ac19963cfdabc8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「Gaze on Me!」などゲームの楽曲や \\n録りおろしソロ曲を収録！\\n CD『WINNING LIVE 08』発売中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4478a7361ba376fa9203bd86df398eb9ad7a04d7c17a3ed128d85cb199cd113",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2169f22828fc0b6c81dd8c5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ちっこいウマ娘たちによるショートアニメ！ \\nアニメ『うまゆる』毎週日曜21：00より \\nぱかチューブっ！にて配信中♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51baa581f07eaadd88380c25d8bd3be7a3f58ad611975e9963d011b5a7371e2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b2c6f394b7d94246d8ed4f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "描き下ろし表紙で「ウマ娘」を大特集！\\n三冠ウマ娘座談会など16Pの大ボリューム\\n「Number」1061号好評発売中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c83aa4edefa0edf506c4119dbde76cdcd5eaaeab586de151c726177cd765d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a23325ca6ff0a898b40d85b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「東京メガイルミ」コラボ開催中！！\\n 詳しくは公式サイトをチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16bedc95d683d702ec1229cee9dee3752cc368d075486dc0c97dcba55a6e482",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27dc0137f684a8278229fa4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘初のドームライブ！\\n4thイベント EXTRA STAGEを\\n配信でも楽しもう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9577e33cd0f4d078a79a47639b85585864c7ed167b5b611f34d6290df792c65b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26cbfeaf056ad211ab24f31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "舞台「ウマ娘 プリティーダービー」\\n～Sprinters' Story～\\n詳しくは公式サイトをチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd906c8d1c07a14374420bc172ea57b59997b86cc01c138bef9ec95d8352fab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5925937cf16a1c9688d56893",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "セブン－イレブンキャンペーン\\n2月16日(木)～3月8日(水)にて開催！\\n詳しくは公式サイトをチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c19a7e2954ad14219b9e2c620cce24f7fac034700d17c6533388a7f8721d6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9399b2a8fbafe23bcf31d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "We are BoC’z！\\n無帽じゃもう、いられない──\\n特設サイト期間限定で公開中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23879618c17d4860e3f696b79212ad9f952f66d54b56917dd9e0254494c48cb6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4358f0a063b9c441f5f1e0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新たな夢が芽吹く…！\\n『ウマ娘 プリティーダービー\\nスターブロッサム』連載開始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81e0c92fd2a338e4cc009bb2f4a9cf385e9526238d4f74e6f5c2f094c15e1fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192b37eb09c1f8a77c392ff6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新たなGW！？　ギャルウィーク到来！\\n特別な動画を「ぱかチューブっ!」にて\\n公開中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31dea079a66507f06e0302afcc6717316eedfd84f5aed0e50687042b1df9b3cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b80605eb20426ff01d90055",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新シリーズ配信アニメプロジェクト始動！\\nアニメ『ROAD TO THE TOP』\\n「ぱかチューブっ!」にて配信中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "098a61bc99baa793f74fabf1fae3a69b66b8c94586512f4c9be4e2b3550f7c58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1474f702ff9e1444d8c28eae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "5th EVENT GO BEYOND -WISH-\\n2023年7月15日(土)、16日(日)より\\nスタート！ 詳細は特設サイトへ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c1f7d536aafe4a22d5118031e60286204ab955571b99c657a1c8efdd88181dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
